[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030143262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117274#issuecomment-4030143262","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117274","id":4030143262,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wNxse","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T10:00:36Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T10:00:36Z","body":"Please provide an MRP to make this easier to test and fix:\n- A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the `.godot` folder in the archive (but keep `project.godot`).\n- Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n- Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**\n- **Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030143262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030212603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117274#issuecomment-4030212603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117274","id":4030212603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wOCn7","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T10:11:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T10:11:20Z","body":"Are you mixing 2D and GUI (Control) nodes? For right-to-left languages GUI nodes are mirrored, but this can have unexpected results if parent of GUI node is 2D node, since 2D nodes doesn't have defined size.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030212603/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030275797","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117274#issuecomment-4030275797","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117274","id":4030275797,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wOSDV","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T10:20:46Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T10:20:46Z","body":"If controls and in the other control it is mirrored inside root control bounds:\n\nLTR:\n<img width=\"816\" height=\"412\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5e683838-6d5e-4cef-a303-d4c8ea60c9b5\" />\nRTL:\n<img width=\"812\" height=\"401\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d8673bb-6ae0-4fe1-97f6-7660e1f33d64\" />\n\nBut if root node is 2D, there are no bounds, so it is mirrored using its origin:\n<img width=\"845\" height=\"436\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9f63ccc7-cd46-4eb1-ac74-035fa4357f74\" />\n\nIf you need UI inside 2D nodes, add a wrapper Control and set it to always be LTR, other controls will mirror inside it:\n\n<img width=\"898\" height=\"218\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13010894-2e64-41ff-830a-33e066b46a6a\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030275797/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4030295765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117274#issuecomment-4030295765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117274","id":4030295765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wOW7V","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T1